   |    `---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- redundant static UI producer should be removed
   |Help: Remove this no-input/no-tool producer and keep fixed qianji choices on userTask 'ask_screen'.
    |Contract: qianji.bpmn.user_task.interaction.v1 requires fixed interaction metadata to live on the userTask without a no-input/no-tool producer serviceTask.

Expected XML:
```xml
